  "info" : {
    "description" : "### eCrop API based on **AgroConnect eCrop standard version 0.4** \r\n\r\nThis API concerns registration of crop related activities like application of crop protection products and fertilizers and energy and water consumption.\r\n\r\nThis API is based on the [Agroconnect eCrop class model version 0.4](https://www.agroconnect.nl/Portals/10/EnterpriseArchitect/eCrop_json/eCrop_v0_4/index.html).\r\n\r\nApplied standards:\r\n- [API Design Rules version 2.0.2](https://gitdocumentatie.logius.nl/publicatie/api/adr/) of the NL API Strategie (Dutch API Strategy)\r\n- RFC 9457: Problem Details for HTTP APIs (Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF))\r\n- Sematic versioning using Semver\r\n\r\nDesign decisions\r\n- super/subtypes (UML generalisations): subtypes are allOf with $ref to supertype and object with subtype atributes\r\n- UML compositions: hierachy in URI (should be aggegrations in eCrop class model) or array in master-object\r\n\r\nCopyright (c)  AgroConnect 2025",
    "version" : "0.1.0",
    "title" : "AgroConnect eCrop API",
    "contact" : {
      "email" : "bernard@vanraaijadvies.nl",
      "name" : "Bernard van Raaij",
      "url" : ""
    },
    "license" : {
      "name" : "Apache 2.0",
      "url" : "http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.html"
    },
    "termsOfService" : ""
  },
  "tags" : [ {
    "name" : "general",
